{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56517","headline":"巨胜歌（幷序） 六 · 柳冲用","name":"巨胜歌（幷序） 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"修真链形须守一，参差一二炉间失。\n且将壬子制里蹄，不然更泥扶桑日。\n必令有味到无情，方保元和天性质。\n不要他处觅良媒，夫妻由来相配匹。\n马牙从此胜琅玕，弦望晦朔候迟疾。\n乃知东西定圆方，世人莫谩夸奇术。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳冲用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56517.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56517","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}